#: src/app/screens/settings/backups-section.tsx:192
msgid "Snapshots kept"
msgstr "保留的快照"

#: src/app/screens/settings/backups-section.tsx:79
msgid "Snapshots of the database, written to a folder on the server. Sync that folder off-site — a copy on the same disk doesn't survive the disk."
msgstr "数据库快照保存在服务器文件夹中。请将该文件夹同步至异地，同一磁盘上的副本无法抵御磁盘故障。"

#: src/app/screens/settings/backups-section.tsx:124
msgid "This server runs on Postgres. Built-in backups cover SQLite only — back up Postgres with pg_dump or your provider's snapshots."
msgstr "此服务器使用 Postgres。内置备份仅支持 SQLite，请使用 pg_dump 或服务商快照备份 Postgres。"
